      "cooked": "<p>Hi  I first tested v16.3</p>\n<p>as the pic below， when purchase order had decimal amount，submit got error:</p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-493214-response-data-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493214-response-data-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Response Data</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">{\n\t\"exception\": \"TypeError: can only concatenate str (not \\\"NoneType\\\") to str\",\n\t\"exc_type\": \"TypeError\",\n\t\"_exc_source\": \"erpnext (app)\"\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f\" title=\"V16.3\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f_2_690x483.png\" alt=\"V16.3\" data-base62-sha1=\"ntxpbzV6k7vYUZgOKGCOBpsz1TN\" width=\"690\" height=\"483\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f_2_690x483.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f_2_1035x724.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a488cdceda556de6c8f224b5a33f47e2d3b9314f_2_1380x966.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6E6E6E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">V16.3</span><span class=\"informations\">1795×1259 111 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>When I modify the product price to be an integer value(eg. xyz.00), submit with no error</p>\n<p>Then I set up ERPNext v15.95.2 in docker， this is all ok</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.